{# stock/content_engine/templates/index_leaderboard.md.j2 #}
{% extends "_base.md.j2" %}
{% block body %}
<div class="hero">
  <p class="wordmark">CONDOR14 · QuantOptions Data Lab</p>
  <h1>Live 30-Day Hold-to-Expiration Performance</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Real OPRA quotes · Held to expiration · Open source</p>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="num">{{ hero.days_running }}</div>
      <div class="lbl">days tracking</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="num">{{ hero.setups_tracked }}</div>
      <div class="lbl">setups tracked</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat stat--progress">
      <div class="num">{{ hero.progress_label }}</div>
      <div class="lbl">leaderboard live</div>
      <div class="bar"><span style="width: 100%"></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

Each row reflects realized outcomes for the listed ticker over the past 30 days, computed under a strictly passive hold-to-expiration assumption. Sample size shown for transparency; tickers with fewer than 5 settled setups are listed but flagged as low-confidence.

## Performance Leaderboard

{% if leaderboard_rows %}
| Ticker | Win Rate | Setups Tracked | Max Drawdown | Worst Single Loss | Last Settlement |
| :--- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | :--- |
{% for r in leaderboard_rows %}| [{{ r.ticker }}](/{{ r.ticker|lower }}/) | {{ "%.0f"|format(r.win_rate * 100) }}% | {{ r.setups_tracked }} | ${{ "%.0f"|format(r.max_drawdown) }} | ${{ "%.0f"|format(r.worst_single_loss) }} | {{ r.last_settlement.isoformat() if r.last_settlement else "—" }} |
{% endfor %}{% else %}
*No settled setups in the last 30 days.*
{% endif %}

## Today's Highest Premium Setups

{% if highest_premium_setups %}
| Ticker | Sector | Net Credit | Max Loss |
| :--- | :--- | ---: | ---: |
{% for s in highest_premium_setups %}| [{{ s.ticker }}](/{{ s.ticker|lower }}/) | {{ s.sector }} | ${{ "%.2f"|format(s.net_credit_at_open) }} | ${{ "%.2f"|format(s.max_loss) }} |
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

